- * Memory model:
- *   Xbox data sections are mapped to their original VAs via
- *   CreateFileMapping + MapViewOfFileEx (see xbox_memory.h).
- *   Recompiled code accesses globals via pointer casts, e.g.:
- *     *(uint32_t*)0x003B2360
